<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-007" chapter-id="c-liangshu-007-xietiao-princesses" source-id="s-liangshu-007-xietiao-princesses-ws1566494">
  <p id="c-liangshu-007-xietiao-princesses:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter">高祖德皇后郗氏，諱<persName id="c-liangshu-007-xietiao-princesses:p001:m0009" ref="4qz_j9r_edj">徽</persName>，高平金鄉人也。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-007-xietiao-princesses:p002" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter">高祖始娉焉。生永興公主<persName id="c-liangshu-007-xietiao-princesses:p002:m0011" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_A">玉姚</persName>，永世公主<persName id="c-liangshu-007-xietiao-princesses:p002:m0018" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_B">玉婉</persName></p>
</text>
